<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Aid</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 2)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast aid &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast aid</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Closes the bleeding wounds of someone who is dying: a target below zero hit 
points comes back to a few hit points and stops bleeding to death. The better 
your spell, the more they get back. On anyone who isn't dying, nothing 
happens.
</p><p>Its great advantage is that you can cast it on yourself even when you are 
mortally wounded and can do nothing else. It is also found on scrolls and 
potions.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mortally Wounded</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Incapacitated</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help First Aid</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cure Light Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>